<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister shall appoint a Director General of Quarantine and Inspection and a Deputy Director General of Quarantine and Inspection and other officers from among the public officers as may be considered necessary for the purpose of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
