<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
