<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Without prejudice to the generality of subsection (2), the enforcement officer referred to in subsection (5) shall comply with any policy, directive and requirement as the Minister charged with the responsibility for health may determine. Appointment of public officers to be enforcement officers"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
