<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The functions of the Coordination Committee are to coordinate technical, scientific, procedural and other relevant matters to facilitate the implementation of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
