<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The chairman and members of the Coordination Committee shall be appointed by the Minister."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
