<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The members of the Coordination Committee shall consist of representatives from the relevant agencies or departments and other agencies or departments which the Minister thinks necessary."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
