<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_10__subsec_9> <https://schema.org/text> "The Coordination Committee may regulate its own procedure."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
