<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act shall be read together with the relevant written laws and the provisions of this Act shall be in addition to, and not in derogation of, the provisions of the relevant written laws."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
