<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "In the event of any inconsistencies between the provisions of this Act and the relevant written laws, excluding the Food Act 1983 [Act 281], the provisions of this Act shall prevail. Interpretation"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
