<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_VII__cl_46__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "The Director General may, in writing, delegate his functions and duties under this section to any enforcement officers subject to such terms and conditions as he thinks fit, but a delegation under this subsection shall not preclude the Director General from performing or exercising the functions and duties that have been delegated. Institution of prosecution"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
