<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_VII__cl_47> <https://schema.org/text> "No prosecution for or in relation to any offence under this Act shall be instituted without the sanction in writing of the Public Prosecutor. Protection against suit and legal proceedings"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
