<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_VII__cl_50__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_VII__cl_50__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding the coming into operation of this Act, until such time as the relevant written laws, excluding the Food Act 1983, are amended in consequence of this Act and the amendments come into operation, the relevant agency or department shall continue to carry out the quarantine, inspection, enforcement and certification of import and export of any plant, animal, carcass, fish, agricultural produce, soil or microorganism."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
