<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_VI__cl_16__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "An enforcement officer shall only carry out the powers under this Part at the entry points, quarantine stations and quarantine premises."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_VI__cl_16__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_VI__cl_16> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
