<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_VI__cl_18__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "An enforcement officer making an arrest under subsection (1) shall, without unnecessary delay, bring the person arrested to the nearest police station, and thereafter the person shall be dealt with according to the law relating to criminal procedure for the time being in force. Search and seizure with warrant"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
