<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_VI__cl_22> <https://schema.org/text> "In exercise of the powers under sections 19 and 20, an enforcement officer may seal temporarily any premises and conveyance situated at the entry point, quarantine station and quarantine premises. Access to computerized data"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
