<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_VI__cl_28__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "If any such person refuses to attend as required by an order made under subsection (1), the enforcement officer may report his refusal to a Magistrate who shall issue a warrant to secure the attendance of such person as may be required by the order. Forfeiture of seized plant, animal, carcass, etc."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
