<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_VI__cl_29__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_VI__cl_29> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
