<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_VI__cl_35__para_c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_VI__cl_35__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "to make such enquiries as may be necessary to ascertain whether the provisions of this Act have been complied with. Obstruction of enforcement officers"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
