<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "No person shall export any plant, animal, carcass, fish, agricultural produce, soil or microorganism without a permit or licence issued under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_V__cl_11__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_V__cl_11> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
