<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@/~part_V__cl_12__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "The Director General shall issue any permit, licence or certificate to import and any permit or licence to export in accordance with the policy, directive and requirement as determined by the relevant agency or department. False permit, licence and certificate"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/44/eng@> .
